Z||000001||My7Fieros||10-11-2001||01:49 AM||||If you're talking about replacing your sail window (the black triangle window thing) on your notchback, then no...theres nothing made to replace it except for identical replacement windows....<BR>The Fiero Store carries the "scoop" style for the fastbacks...but thats because fastback models have an actual "window" of sorts...if you were to take off the sail window on a notchback, you would see plastic and the frame..no "true window".<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
